## 13. Troubleshooting Summary
### Incident
User could see the Operations mapped drive but could not access it.
### Symptoms
```text
O: drive visible
Domain authentication working
Mapped-drive GPO working
Operations share inaccessible
```
### Investigation
```cmd
whoami /groups
net use
gpresult /r
net user jreed /domain
klist
```
Server-side verification included:
```powershell
Get-ADGroupMember "Operations-Users"
```
### Root Cause
Required security-group membership was missing.
### Resolution
Restored `Operations-Users` membership and refreshed the user's authentication/session state.
### Verification
The user regained Modify access to the Operations share, and the expected security group appeared in the refreshed security context.

